{
	"name": "Go Without",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/environment/wilderness/terrain-rocky-ground.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>You may consume twice the Supply you ordinarily would for a number of weeks equal to your Constitution modifier. For that number of weeks, you do not need to consume additional Supply, and you do not suffer the effects of going without Supply for the duration. Once you have used this ability, you may not do so again for the next month.</p>",
